  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.JsonGetValue(JSON: string, Specifiers: {any}): string`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`string llJsonGetValue(string JSON, list Specifiers);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p class="deprecated-text"><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>Deprecated:  use lljson.decode because Also, the indices are zero-based.</span></p>
      <p>  <p>Gets the value indicated by specifiers from the <a href="http://json.org" target="_blank">json</a> string.</p>
  <p>Returns a string made by parsing <b>json</b>, a string representing json and traversing as specified by <b>specifiers</b>.</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>string</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>string</span></td>
          <td>JSON / json</td>
          <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>{`{any}`}</span></td>
          <td><span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span>list</span></td>
